<LegalLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How Fini's Kitchens uses information submitted through this website."
>
  <Fragment slot="summary">
    This notice explains how information submitted through the Fini's Kitchens website is used when you make an enquiry.
  </Fragment>

  <h2>Who we are</h2>
  <p>
    <strong>FINI'S KITCHENS LTD</strong><br />
    Company number 16193287<br />
    Registered office: 9 Highfield Lane, Chichester, United Kingdom, PO20 2DL
  </p>
  <p>FINI'S KITCHENS LTD is the data controller for customer enquiries submitted through this website.</p>
  <p>
    Privacy contact:
    <a href="mailto:oli.wyatt@thefinigroup.co.uk">oli.wyatt@thefinigroup.co.uk</a>
  </p>

  <h2>Information we collect</h2>
  <p>When you send an enquiry, we may collect:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>your name and email address;</li>
    <li>your telephone number, if supplied;</li>
    <li>your project or enquiry details and project timeline;</li>
    <li>information you voluntarily include in your message; and</li>
    <li>basic technical and security information generated when you use the website.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Why we use it</h2>
  <p>We use this information to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>respond to enquiries;</li>
    <li>discuss potential kitchen projects;</li>
    <li>provide requested quotations or information;</li>
    <li>protect the enquiry service from spam, abuse and security threats; and</li>
    <li>operate and troubleshoot the website.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Lawful basis</h2>
  <p>
    For customer enquiries, processing is generally necessary to take steps at your request before potentially entering into a contract.
    For website security, abuse prevention and technical operation, legitimate interests may apply.
  </p>

  <h2>Who receives the information</h2>
  <p>Information may be processed by service providers necessary to operate the website and enquiry service, including:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>South Coast Apps for website hosting and technical services;</li>
    <li>Cloudflare Turnstile for spam and abuse prevention; and</li>
    <li>email/SMTP infrastructure used to deliver enquiries.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    Website enquiries are transmitted to Fini's Kitchens by email rather than stored in a customer enquiry database by the website.
  </p>
  <p>We do not sell personal information.</p>

  <h2>How long information is kept</h2>
  <p>
    We keep enquiry information only for as long as reasonably necessary to respond to your enquiry, manage any resulting business relationship and meet applicable
    legal or accounting obligations.
  </p>
  <p>Technical logs may be retained for a limited period for security, troubleshooting and abuse prevention.</p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    UK data-protection law gives you rights that may include requesting access to, correction, deletion or restriction of your personal information where applicable.
    To make a request, contact <a href="mailto:oli.wyatt@thefinigroup.co.uk">oli.wyatt@thefinigroup.co.uk</a>. You can also complain to the
    <a href="https://ico.org.uk/" rel="external">Information Commissioner's Office</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Updates</h2>
  <p>This notice may be updated from time to time.</p>
</LegalLayout>
